/* Anonymous usage sheet */
"4 项都已开启" = "All 4 are on";
"LaunchUS 免费，没有账号也没有广告，我们不知道是谁在用它。这些匿名信息是我们了解 LaunchUS 用得好不好的唯一办法，用来决定先修什么、先做什么。每一项都可以单独关掉。" = "LaunchUS is free, with no accounts and no ads, so we don't know who uses it. This anonymous information is our only way to learn how well LaunchUS works, and it decides what we fix and build first. Each item can be turned off on its own.";
"LaunchUS 崩溃时 macOS 记下的崩溃类型、原因、出错的函数名和版本号，下次打开时发送。" = "What macOS records when LaunchUS crashes: the kind of crash, the reason, the functions it happened in and the version. Sent the next time it opens.";
